<Layout title="Documents & privacy"><PageHero eyebrow="PROTECT YOUR INFORMATION" title="Share thoughtfully." text="Your first registration should start a conversation, not require your whole document history."/><article class="container prose"><h2>What the registration asks for</h2><p>We ask for contact details, citizenship, residence, your requested service and a brief background relevant to your plans. Review the privacy notice before submitting.</p><h2>What to leave out</h2><p>Do not enter passport numbers, bank details, passwords, medical information or other sensitive records in the initial form. There is no document upload at this stage.</p><h2>If documents are requested later</h2><p>Confirm your representative’s identity, why each document is required and the secure channel to use. Share only relevant records. Ask how access, retention and deletion are handled before you upload.</p><h2>Protect your tracking link</h2><p>Your private link and access key allow access to your intake status. Keep them private, avoid using shared devices and contact Verto if you believe someone else has access.</p><h2>Drafts on your device</h2><p>You may choose to save a registration draft in this browser’s session storage. It remains available during the browser session and is removed on successful submission. Use “Clear draft” to remove it sooner, especially on a shared device.</p><a href="/privacy/">Read the full privacy notice ↗</a></article></Layout>
